p=out/'Documentation/Project/NPCDex-ROMDex-Decision-Log.md';t=p.read_text()+'''\n\n## October 20 — Preparation Feedback and Shared Characters\n\nThe owner chose one character tile containing linked placements. MAPDex and NPCDex now expose explicit reviewed linking while retaining each placement's source mapping and local content/history. Sprite selection previews immediately and commits explicitly; generated regions use the HGSS enum. Stage descriptions show ROM evidence without claiming a completed narrative timeline. The first installed startup exposed the 30-second service deadline being exceeded by a saved-map presentation checkpoint; final 0.5.25 defers it until MAPDex loading and passed actual saved-data cold-start checks. Full narrative-phase acceptance remains open in RI03C. [Report](../History/MAPDex-0.5.24/MAPDex-0.5.25-Completion-Report.md).\n''';p.write_text(t)
